{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21794","headline":"有鸟二十章 八 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟名啄木，木中求食常不足。\n偏啄邓林求一虫，虫孔未穿长觜秃。\n木皮已穴虫在信，虫蚀木心根柢覆。\n可怜树上百鸟儿，有时飞向新林宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}